Multi-level closure capture: inner() references x from outer() but
our closure detection only captures from the immediate parent.
Also covers: for-loop variable scoping (enumerate unpacking),
comprehension variable leaking, and global/nonlocal declarations.
Affects ~54 ESBMC tests.
